Ghost Wolf Bite
    Events
        Unit - A unit Starts the effect of an ability
    Conditions
        (Ability being cast) Equal to ENHANCEMENT_Bite (Ghost Wolf)
    Actions
        -------- == ABILITY MODIFIER == --------
        Set VariableSet Ability_TempLevel = (Level of (Ability being cast) for (Triggering unit))
        Set VariableSet Ability_TempAmount = (Ability_GhostWolfBite_Base[Ability_TempLevel] + (1.50 x (Real((Strength of (Triggering unit) (Include bonuses))))))
        -------- ==   == --------
        Sound - Play Bite <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to (Triggering unit)
        -------- I'll create some variables at first to make things easier. --------
        Set VariableSet BiteCaster = (Triggering unit)
        Set VariableSet BitePoints[1] = (Position of BiteCaster)
        Set VariableSet BitePoints[2] = (BitePoints[1] offset by 50.00 towards (Facing of BiteCaster) degrees.)
        -------- Now let's create a dummy to cast the damage that we has just created. --------
        Unit - Create 1 DummyBite for (Owner of BiteCaster) at BitePoints[2] facing Default building facing degrees
        Set VariableSet BiteDummy = (Last created unit)
        -------- I'm adding expiration time to make it disappear after 0.5 second, and give it an ability. --------
        Unit - Add a 0.50 second Generic expiration timer to BiteDummy
        -------- check for Bite Level (1-5) --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Level of ENHANCEMENT_Bite (Ghost Wolf) for BiteCaster) Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                Unit - Add ENHANCEMENT_BiteLevel1  to BiteDummy
                Ability - Set Ability: (Unit: BiteDummy's Ability with Ability Code: ENHANCEMENT_BiteLevel1 )'s Real Level Field: Damage Per Target ('Efk1') of Level: ((Level of ENHANCEMENT_BiteLevel1  for BiteDummy) - 1) to Ability_TempAmount
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Level of ENHANCEMENT_Bite (Ghost Wolf) for BiteCaster) Equal to 2
            Then - Actions
                Unit - Add ENHANCEMENT_BiteLevel2  to BiteDummy
                Ability - Set Ability: (Unit: BiteDummy's Ability with Ability Code: ENHANCEMENT_BiteLevel2 )'s Real Level Field: Damage Per Target ('Efk1') of Level: ((Level of ENHANCEMENT_BiteLevel2  for BiteDummy) - 1) to Ability_TempAmount
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Level of ENHANCEMENT_Bite (Ghost Wolf) for BiteCaster) Equal to 3
            Then - Actions
                Unit - Add ENHANCEMENT_BiteLevel3  to BiteDummy
                Ability - Set Ability: (Unit: BiteDummy's Ability with Ability Code: ENHANCEMENT_BiteLevel3 )'s Real Level Field: Damage Per Target ('Efk1') of Level: ((Level of ENHANCEMENT_BiteLevel3  for BiteDummy) - 1) to Ability_TempAmount
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Level of ENHANCEMENT_Bite (Ghost Wolf) for BiteCaster) Equal to 4
            Then - Actions
                Unit - Add ENHANCEMENT_BiteLevel4  to BiteDummy
                Ability - Set Ability: (Unit: BiteDummy's Ability with Ability Code: ENHANCEMENT_BiteLevel4 )'s Real Level Field: Damage Per Target ('Efk1') of Level: ((Level of ENHANCEMENT_BiteLevel4  for BiteDummy) - 1) to Ability_TempAmount
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Level of ENHANCEMENT_Bite (Ghost Wolf) for BiteCaster) Equal to 5
            Then - Actions
                Unit - Add ENHANCEMENT_BiteLevel5  to BiteDummy
                Ability - Set Ability: (Unit: BiteDummy's Ability with Ability Code: ENHANCEMENT_BiteLevel5 )'s Real Level Field: Damage Per Target ('Efk1') of Level: ((Level of ENHANCEMENT_BiteLevel5  for BiteDummy) - 1) to Ability_TempAmount
            Else - Actions
        -------- It's time to cast them! So let's add this action. --------
        Unit - Order BiteDummy to Night Elf Warden - Fan Of Knives.
        -------- Time to remove leaks in order to prevent ingame lags. --------
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BitePoints[1])
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BitePoints[2])
        -------- You're done! --------
        -------- Q: Why do you use Warden - Fan of Knives ability to order dummy cast spells? --------
        -------- A: Because we the melee damage spell was based from Fan of Knives. --------
